{"racine_id":"1875270696064184424","n_nodes":8,"max_depth":7,"root_rt":0,"subtree_rt":0,"mass_in_root":1.0,"quote_share":0.0,"n_reply":7,"n_quote":0,"median_latency_h":0.016,"t_min":1735934349,"t_max":1735935197,"span_h":0.236,"peak_node_id":"1875273097915593215","peak_rt":0,"root_author":"kumudaspeaks","root_text":"Why isn’t there a vaccine for human metapneumovirus (#hMPV)? Let’s break it down: 🧵 https://t.co/i6AhP1BRUA","root_iso":"2025-01-03T19:59:09Z","nodes":[{"id":"1875270696064184424","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"t":1735934349,"iso":"2025-01-03T19:59:09Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"ancre","niveau":0,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"Why isn’t there a vaccine for human metapneumovirus (#hMPV)? Let’s break it down: 🧵 https://t.co/i6AhP1BRUA","in_corpus":true,"depth":0,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":8,"dt_root_h":0.0,"parent_id":"","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875273097915593215","x":0.675708,"y":0.0,"t":1735934922,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:08:42Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"🦠 Complex Virus: hMPV is part of the paramyxovirus family, which mutates and evolves, making it difficult to create a stable and effective vaccine","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":7,"dt_root_h":0.159,"parent_id":"1875270696064184424","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875273234637299952","x":0.713443,"y":0.0,"t":1735934954,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:09:14Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"🕵️ New Discovery: hMPV was only identified in 2001. Compared to older viruses like the flu, research is still in its early stages.","in_corpus":true,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":6,"dt_root_h":0.168,"parent_id":"1875273097915593215","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875273326140314077","x":0.739387,"y":0.0,"t":1735934976,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:09:36Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"⚠️ Low Priority: hMPV often causes mild symptoms in healthy individuals. It hasn’t been seen as urgent compared to more deadly viruses like COVID-19 or SARS.","in_corpus":true,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.174,"parent_id":"1875273234637299952","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875273583100076150","x":0.811321,"y":0.0,"t":1735935037,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:10:37.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"👶👵 Target Groups: The virus mostly affects young children, the elderly, and those with weakened immune systems. Designing a vaccine specifically for these groups is a challenge.","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":0.191,"parent_id":"1875273326140314077","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875273731234533536","x":0.853774,"y":0.0,"t":1735935073,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:11:13.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"💰 Economic Hurdles: Vaccine development is expensive and time-consuming. Without major outbreaks or demand, companies hesitate to invest.","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":0.201,"parent_id":"1875273583100076150","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875273981512790089","x":0.923349,"y":0.0,"t":1735935132,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:12:12Z","rt":0,"replies":2,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"However, with advances in mRNA vaccine technology, there’s hope for quicker development if hMPV becomes a bigger public health threat.","in_corpus":true,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":0.217,"parent_id":"1875273731234533536","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"},{"id":"1875274252666204375","x":1.0,"y":0.0,"t":1735935197,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:13:17.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":7,"author":"kumudaspeaks","author_id":"1871853747518816256","text":"Prevention is key until then 🧼 Wash hands, 😷 wear masks, and stay informed. Stay safe!","in_corpus":false,"depth":7,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.236,"parent_id":"1875273981512790089","conversation_id":"1875270696064184424"}],"edges":[{"source":"1875270696064184424","target":"1875273097915593215","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875273097915593215","target":"1875273234637299952","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875273234637299952","target":"1875273326140314077","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875273326140314077","target":"1875273583100076150","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875273583100076150","target":"1875273731234533536","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875273731234533536","target":"1875273981512790089","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875273981512790089","target":"1875274252666204375","relation":"reply"}]}